      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "5-Star Review for NG Solar and Electrical InstallationWe sought out three quotes and ultimately chose NG Elec based on their technical proposal and Nathan’s exceptional ability to explain a complex subject in a way that made sense to the non-technical person in our household—this was a standout factor for us. Price was also a consideration, and their clear communication and professionalism sealed the deal.From accepting the quote to installation day, NG Elec kept us well-informed at every step, demonstrating a well-organised and efficient operation.On installation day, the team arrived on time, assessed the job, and got straight to work. It was clear they knew exactly what they were doing, and their camaraderie showed they worked seamlessly together. By 2:00 PM, our system was up and running, with no mess left behind.Nathan took the time to walk us through the phone apps for monitoring the system, explaining everything in a way that was easy to understand.Nathan, your team is a credit to you, and we wouldn’t hesitate to recommend NG Elec to anyone. If we could give a 6-star rating, we absolutely would! ??????And please pass out thanks and appreciation on to your team.",
